{"title":"패도신공","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=MtV82/hzVqGYi4Bs/gvfTncQBowRGt3fad866NK&filename=th3","synopsis":"군인 출신 조직폭력배 ‘곽건군’\n착하게 살고 싶었으나 세상은 그를 가만히 두지 않았고,\n결국 형장의 이슬이 되어 굴곡진 삶을 마무리하게 될 줄 알았다.\n\n그런데\n날아온 건 총알이 아닌 하늘에서 떨어진 번개였다.\n눈을 번쩍 뜨니 새로운 세계가 펼쳐졌다.\n\n황제와 요괴, 그리고 신선이 살아 숨 쉬는 시대\n정파와 마도, 세가와 세가가 암투를 벌이는 세계\n약육강식의 땅에서 유약한 상인의 아들로 태어난 ‘월천수’\n\n소년의 몸으로 들어간 무뢰배는 과연 어떻게 이 험한 세상에서 살아남을 수 있을까,\n그리고 어떻게 우화등선을 하여 피맺힌 전생의 설움을 털어낼 수 있을까?\n\n원제 : 수진계패뢰(修眞界敗類)","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":233,"change":{"type":"up","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":215,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":234,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":299,"change":{"type":"down","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":83}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":252,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":280,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":271,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":211,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":247,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":217,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":209,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date"